{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：22:47 2026-11-22 HKT</p>\n<img alt=\"金馬獎2026｜袁澧林首奪金馬影后  台上淚崩多謝古天樂  劉嘉玲頒獎提梁朝偉掀高潮\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f6156176a67889b64dedffd57989f1e6/2026-11/KF_-_2026-11-22T232850_132.png\"/>\n<p>【金馬獎2026／第63屆金馬獎／金馬63】台灣電影界年度盛事「第63屆金馬獎」於今晚（22日）假台北流行音樂中心舉行。袁澧林憑《第四幕》的出色表現，成功擊敗余香凝、鍾雪瑩、梁翠珊等強敵，成功奪得金馬獎最佳女主角，從劉嘉玲手上接過獎項，成為金馬影后。</p>\n<h2>袁澧林多謝古天樂</h2>\n<p>袁澧林以一頭金髮Look出席今次金馬獎，亦為她帶來好運，她聽到自己的名字後強壓心中的激動情緒，接受全場雷動掌聲。袁澧林於台上哭着擁着劉嘉玲，並表示「我終於拿影后」。她之後多謝古天樂，以及多謝導演不讓她演小綿羊，可以演大灰狼。</p>\n<img alt=\"劉嘉玲做頒獎嘉賓提梁朝偉掀全場高潮。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/29b703765f04b34df449f7e19dc67885/2026-11/VS--YouTube-63The63rdGoldenHorseAwardsCeremony-YouTube-244_37_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"劉嘉玲負責頒最佳女主角獎。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1043a45166f4db3489c3a7fc3199090c/2026-11/VS--YouTube-63The63rdGoldenHorseAwardsCeremony-YouTube-248_00_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"袁澧林首奪金馬影后。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/60d6654479cc14715142bc12242ce093/2026-11/VS--YouTube-63The63rdGoldenHorseAwardsCeremony-YouTube-248_09_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"袁澧林立即哭了出來。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4dc06eb992b8412042671f265278de3b/2026-11/VS--YouTube-63The63rdGoldenHorseAwardsCeremony-YouTube-248_10_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"袁澧林不敢相信。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ad24ce8939c79b93f062a03030a7114d/2026-11/VS--YouTube-63The63rdGoldenHorseAwardsCeremony-YouTube-248_13_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"袁澧林和劉嘉玲擁抱。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5165ad402c43f6c0de12a085512e40e4/2026-11/VS--YouTube-63The63rdGoldenHorseAwardsCeremony-YouTube-248_39_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"袁澧林接過獎項。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/132eb765e509150b1ae51ea000cc206a/2026-11/VS--YouTube-63The63rdGoldenHorseAwardsCeremony-YouTube-248_42_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"袁澧林好激動。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/23b46e0acc2e9149ffdf479366086aea/2026-11/VS--YouTube-63The63rdGoldenHorseAwardsCeremony-YouTube-248_49_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"袁澧林表示「我拿影后喇」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9cc70fac81446e800cafb8710143004d/2026-11/VS--YouTube-63The63rdGoldenHorseAwardsCeremony-YouTube-248_51_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"袁澧林第二次挑戰金馬影后就成功奪獎。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7f229bb8e268a380487534854e865e9d/2026-11/VS--YouTube-63The63rdGoldenHorseAwardsCeremony-YouTube-250_59_.jpg\"/>\n<h2>劉嘉玲提梁朝偉掀高潮</h2>\n<p>劉嘉玲今次負責頒最佳女主角獎，她表示：「其實我也曾3次提名金馬影后，但我卻3次都落敗。但幸好我家的，曾奪過3次金馬獎，他對我說，這3座獎項都歸你所有！」十分搞笑。</p>\n<h2>袁澧林二次挑戰成功封后</h2>\n<p>袁澧林今次是憑《第四幕》，第二次入圍金馬獎「最佳女主角」，之前她曾憑《窄路微塵》首次提名。袁澧林於《第四幕》中飾演漢娜，是一名在徵選中脫穎而出的素人演員，也是激發導演歐文（馮德倫飾）創作力並讓戲劇與現實界線模糊的關鍵人物。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T15:43:59.547779+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":490,"images":11,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T14:47:54+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T21:37:46.485123+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T15:37:29.149112+00:00","content_hash":"19c254286653a884f3e64d61f3b1065397757ff35822982d14a7938174adef60","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}